        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yosia alilikana vasaka kwondũ wa Yeova ku Yelusaleme: na mooaa vasaka mũthenya wa ĩkũmi na ĩna wa mwei wa mbee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
