          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aia athembi mawĩanĩ moo, na amekĩa vinya ngoonĩ ũthũkũminĩ wa nyũmba ya Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na amea Alivai ala mamanyĩasya Isilaeli onthe, ala maĩ atheu kwa Yeova, Likyai ĩsandũkũ ĩtheu nyũmbanĩ ĩla Solomoni mwana wa Ndaviti mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli wakie; yĩtikethĩwa ĩngĩ mũio ituonĩ syenyu. Yu thũkũmai Yeova Ngai wenyu, na andũ make Isilaeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
