              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũu mĩw’o ũthũkũmi waseũvĩtw’e, na athembi maũngama vandũ voo, na Alivai kwĩanana na nguthu syoo, kwĩanana na mwĩao wa mũsumbĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
