          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na maveta nthembo sya kũvĩvw’a, nĩ kana maithembe kwĩanana na nguthu sya nyũmba sya aaĩthe sya ana ma ala andũ, mamũthembee Yeova, o tondũ kũandĩkĩtwe ĩvukunĩ ya Mose. Na now’o meekie na ng’ombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mavĩvya vasaka na mwaki kwĩanana na ũtw’ĩo: na nthembo ila ntheu maua na mbisũ, na iteve, na tũteve, na maikua na mĩtũkĩ mamatwaĩa ana onthe ma ala andũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
