          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina maseũvya kwondũ woo ene, na kwondũ wa athembi, nĩkwĩthĩwa athembi, ana ma Aluni, makwete wĩa wa kũthemba nthembo sya kũvĩvw’a na mathunya kũvika kwatuka: kwondũ wa ũu Alivai maseũvya kwondũ woo ene o na kwondũ wa athembi, ana ma Aluni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aini, ana ma Asavu, maĩ vandũ voo, kwĩanana na mwĩao wa Ndaviti, na Asavu, na Emani, na Yetuthuni mwoni wa kwa mũsumbĩ; na asũvĩi ma mĩomonĩ maĩ kĩla mbingĩlonĩ: matyaĩ vata kũtia ũthũkũmi woo; nũndũ ana‐a‐ĩthe moo Alivai nĩmamaseũvĩsye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
