          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ ũthũkũmi w’onthe wa Yeova waseũvw’a mũthenya ũsu, wa kũlilikana vasaka, na kũthemba nthembo sya kũvĩvw’a kĩthembeonĩ kya Yeova, kwĩanana na mwĩao wa mũsumbĩ Yosia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ana ma Isilaeli ala maĩ vo malilikana vasaka ĩvinda yĩu, na mboka ya kĩmũtũ kĩte ĩlawa mĩthenya mũonza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
